# Copy to .env (never committed). There is normally no reason to: the default is right.
# Read by src/api/client.js at build time. Default: /api on the same origin (D-21).
# A path on this origin only, never another origin: the session and CSRF cookies are
# SameSite=Lax, so login would appear to succeed and every call after it would fail
# (Stage 5 item 9, D-64). vite.config.js refuses to build with anything else.
# In development the Vite dev server proxies /api to http://127.0.0.1:8000 (vite.config.js).
VITE_API_BASE_URL=/api
